  "body": "Brand New 10 Years Master Builder Warranty.  A Sanctuary with Views and Space\r\nHigh ceilings and a wide, open living space set the tone here, running clean from front to back with easy access to both outdoor areas. The kitchen sits central with an island and gas cooking, built for daily use and entertaining. The second ensuite is a standout, tucked away for privacy and perfect for guests, a boarder, or a work from home setup that does not take over the house.\r\n\r\nFeatures and Standouts:\r\nOpen plan living and dining with high ceilings and full-length layout\r\nCentral kitchen with island bench, gas hob, and good storage\r\nFour double bedrooms with built-in wardrobes\r\nMaster with walk-in robe, ensuite, and direct garden access\r\nSecond bedroom with its own ensuite, ideal for guests or flexibility\r\nFamily bathroom with bath and separate shower\r\nDeck and fully fenced backyard with lawn, low maintenance and usable\r\nInternal access double garage with integrated laundry\r\nTwo off-street parks and tidy, landscaped frontage\r\n\r\nDon't miss your chance to secure this stunning new home in a highly sought-after neighborhood. Act now - your dream home awaits!",
